                                                "example_id": "0edadca3-3e2f-4040-a140-e0046dcd2ba6",
                                                "sense_id": "f9dd80ac-6771-389c-a03c-c324ba58d642",
                                                "text": "One answer which has gained scientific popularity puts the egg first – 'no egg, no chicken': […] A competing answer puts it the other way round – 'no chicken, no egg': […]"
